owtext;font-kerning:none;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;user-select:text;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\" paraid=\"577066063\" paraeid=\"{63de9580-ccd2-47c1-8451-fa1103eebc56}{76}\"><br><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW211133775 BCX0 NormalTextRun\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;font-variant-ligatures:none !important;line-height:20.85px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"ES-MX\" lang=\"ES-MX\"><strong>Mayor capacidad de compra:</strong> Accedan a la casa que han pensado&nbsp;y que cumple con sus necesidades. </span></span><span style=\"font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW211133775 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;line-height:20.85px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;white-space:pre !important;\">&nbsp;</span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW211133775 BCX0 NormalTextRun\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;font-variant-ligatures:none !important;line-height:20.85px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"ES-MX\" lang=\"ES-MX\"><strong>Flexibilidad:</strong> No importa si están casados o no, lo importante es que juntos pueden cumplir el sueño de tener un hogar propio. </span></span><span style=\"font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW211133775 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-hi