-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\">con alguien más y lograr mantener ese sueño en pie, </span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW204059491 BCX0 NormalTextRun\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;font-variant-ligatures:none !important;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\"><strong>concediendo un aporte mayor para estrenar&nbsp;tu nuevo hogar</strong></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW204059491 BCX0 NormalTextRun\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;font-variant-ligatures:none !important;font-weight:normal;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\"> tal como un departamento o esa casa tan soñada con las amenidades y cualidades indicadas para tu vida.</span><span class=\"EOP SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;-webkit-user-drag:none;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);cursor:text;direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;overflow:visible;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;user-select:text;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;background-color:transparent;color:windowtext;font-kerning:none;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;user-select:text;vertical-align:baseline;\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\" paraid=\"1272491454\" paraeid=\"{a23ae773-4d43-4edf-b855-454d079e7298}{186}\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW204059491 BCX0 NormalTextRun\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;font-variant-ligatures:none !important;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\"><strong>¿Por qué unirse?</strong></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;-webkit-user-drag:none;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);cursor:text;direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;overflow:visible;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;user-select:text;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;background-color:transparent;color:windowtext;font-kerning:none;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;user-select:text;vertical-align:baseline;\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\" paraid=\"1198896569\" paraeid=\"{82c286eb-53b8-48d0-9b5b-bd963add4234}{7}\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW204059491 BCX0 NormalTextRun\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;font-variant-ligatures:none !important;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\">Unirse es la decisión inteligente para <strong>dejar de ajustar tus sueños a un presupuesto</strong> limitado y empezar a ampliarlos.&nbsp;</span><span class=\"EOP SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;-webkit-user-drag:none;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);cursor:text;direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;overflow:visible;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;user-select:text;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;background-color:transparent;color:windowtext;font-kerning:none;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;user-select:text;vertical-align:baseline;\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\" paraid=\"370584340\" paraeid=\"{f914f293-8743-495a-bec4-73da083064f5}{233}\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW204059491 BCX0 NormalTextRun\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;font-variant-ligatures:none !important;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\">Al sumar fuerzas con alguien más, no solo aumentas tu capacidad de compra para elegir esa vivienda&nbsp;en la zona que siempre imaginaste, sino que también<strong> ganas la tranquilidad de construir un patrimonio con respaldo</strong>, en lugar de postergar tus planes por falta de recursos, esta unión se convierte en el puente definitivo que transforma la frustración de Sofía y Alejandro en la realidad de adquirir&nbsp;un hogar, demostrando que cuando compartes la meta, el camino hacia tu casa propia se vuelve mucho más ligero y alcanzable.</span><span class=\"EOP SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;-webkit-user-drag:none;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);cursor:text;direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;overflow:visible;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;user-select:text;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;background-color:transparent;color:windowtext;font-kerning:none;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;user-select:text;vertical-align:baseline;\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\" paraid=\"349384557\" paraeid=\"{82c286eb-53b8-48d0-9b5b-bd963add4234}{47}\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW204059491 BCX0 NormalTextRun\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;font-variant-ligatures:none !important;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\"><strong>¿Quiénes pueden unirse?</strong></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;-webkit-user-drag:none;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);cursor:text;direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;overflow:visible;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;user-select:text;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;background-color:transparent;color:windowtext;font-kerning:none;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;user-select:text;vertical-align:baseline;\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\" paraid=\"409002728\" paraeid=\"{f957002c-9f96-4fb3-9007-e4c9f87f7829}{49}\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW204059491 BCX0 NormalTextRun\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;font-variant-ligatures:none !important;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"ES-ES\" lang=\"ES-ES\">Lo mejor de este programa es su flexibilidad, ya que está diseñado para que casi <strong>cualquier persona de tu círculo cercano</strong> pueda ser tu aliado.&nbsp;</span><span class=\"EOP SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-drag:none;line-height:20.925px;margin:0px;padding:0px;user-select:text;\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW204059491 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;-webkit-user-drag:none;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);cursor:text;direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;overflow:visible;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial